Exception: the "Still" wallpaper design

The wallpaper shown by GlassBar (folder GlassBar/NativeStill) is an unofficial
recreation of "Still - Minimal Wallpaper for Your Focus" by MrShadow
(https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3829782620).
The idea, visual design and feature set of that wallpaper belong to its author
and are NOT licensed under the MIT License above. This license only covers the
source code written for GlassBar. If you want to reuse the design, ask the
original author.
